  "verdict": "Framework cosmological growth chain (Planck 2018 anchors -> LCDM growth ODE -> f sigma_8(z), S_8, halo MF): f sigma_8 RSD predictions match BOSS/eBOSS at the FACTOR2-or-better level across z in [0.15, 1.0]; S_8 = 0.831 matches Planck-implied (0.831) essentially exactly (consistency check) but reproduces the ~3-sigma S_8 tension with low-z lensing surveys (DES Y3 0.776, KiDS 0.759, HSC 0.776). The framework's halo mass function f(sigma) reproduces Tinker+ 2008 across M in [1e12, 1e15] M_sun. Note: growth chain uses Planck Omega_m and h0 as anchors (no fits); the consistency is the LCDM growth-equation prediction, not a free fit."
